      382.08,
      322.96,
      428.15
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intendsto acquire the following land/ servitude* which is required for apublic purpose:",
